        description="The 戴森 Empire works just like the 戴森 Sidekick except you get an immobile 'King' unit on your home planet. Also, it is recommended to turn the 收割者 Difficulty down as an empire.

The 戴森 Sidekick allows the player to play as Coalition of races trying to build a 戴森球. You will control 天顶, 尖塔, 奈祖尔 and 圣殿骑士 ships. You will build major and minor 要塞 for each of the races, giving you access to different ships. 
Like the 死灵法师, Major 要塞 grant 旗舰, Minor 要塞 will allow for bolstering. Unlike the 死灵法师, You can dismantle a 要塞 using the 黑客 menu, getting back some of the 资源 invested. This allows you to respec your fleets.

In order to build the 戴森球, you will need to 掠夺 a number of planets to get the raw materials by constructing vast 钻机. Since planets are used up in this way, small maps make the game harder for the 戴森 Sidekick.

Enabling the 戴森 Sidekick also adds the '收割者' faction to the game to add additional challenge; use the Difficulty slider to change how much impact the 收割者 will have.
The 天顶 Miners can also add an interesting challenge.

The 戴森 Sidekick is not recommended for players who have not played the Fallen 尖塔 campaign, or played as the 死灵法师. The 戴森 Empire is better with some reasonably strong allied factions (天灾, 斯维卡里, etc), since it is lacking in defensive 建筑.

Designed and Coded by Badger.
戴森 Sidekick Unit Design assistance from Zeusalmighty.
This is only a mod, and has no official Arcen support."/>

