        description="Humans don't even control a single homeworld, but rather exist only in a single 方舟 that must claim a starting world and begin construction from there.

As a sidekick, your 方舟 cannot die, it can only be crippled. You win or lose with your Empire allies.

This mode is based on the earliest test versions of the game, and the Kickstarter design for the game.  Back in 2017, we ultimately decided that this style felt too different from classic AI War, but in 2021 this returned as a challenging and interesting new mode.

This player type also starts with a single 战斗空间站 and a Support 舰队."/>

